{"title": "Ask HN: I Need Advice", "link": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50285134", "summary": "<p>Hello HN.<p>I was laid off six months ago from my longest tenured job. Since then, I have been rotting. And I mean really rotting. I have been staying up late, sleeping in, skipping chores, neglecting my relationships, eating too much food, neglecting hygiene, and generally just being a bum. I have a nest egg that I had saved up for this exact situation, but it appears that it has just made me even lazier. I have not been applying to many jobs, maybe one per week. My main reason has been that I am afraid of interviewing and that my skills are not up to par.<p>I don't know what to do anymore. I need to kick myself into gear, but I am finding it incredibly difficult. I'm not looking for pity, just some assistance from the brain trust here at HN.<p>Thank you for reading.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Comments URL: <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50285134\">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50285134</a></p>\n<p>Points: 4</p>\n<p># Comments: 3</p>", "published": "2026-10-29T06:17:00+00:00", "source": "Hacker News Best", "category": "techblog", "matched_entities": {}, "ontology": {"repo": "BlogRadar", "category": "techblog", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "source_event_model": "blog_post", "event_model_id": "tech.blog_post", "evidence_policy_ids": ["source_metadata", "article_text"], "event_model_payload": {"headline": "Ask HN: I Need Advice", "source_name": "Hacker News Best", "source_url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50285134", "published_at": "2026-10-29T06:17:00+00:00", "summary": "<p>Hello HN.<p>I was laid off six months ago from my longest tenured job. Since then, I have been rotting. And I mean really rotting. I have been staying up late, sleeping in, skipping chores, neglecting my relationships, eating too much food, neglecting hygiene, and generally just being a bum. I have a nest egg that I had saved up for this exact situation, but it appears that it has just made me even lazier. I have not been applying to many jobs, maybe one per week. My main reason has been that I am afraid of interviewing and that my skills are not up to par.<p>I don't know what to do anymore. I need to kick myself into gear, but I am finding it incredibly difficult. I'm not looking for pity, just some assistance from the brain trust here at HN.<p>Thank you for reading.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Comments URL: <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50285134\">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50285134</a></p>\n<p>Points: 4</p>\n<p># Comments: 3</p>"}}, "logged_at": "2026-10-29T06:47:23.218207+00:00"}
